Package: pxvirt-console
Section: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PXVIRT direct console user interface
 Text-mode console for PXVIRT/PVE nodes (tty1 and ssh): system, network,
 disks, services/logs and PVE cluster management, rescue tools and a
 graphical VM console (SDL2/KMSDRM or terminal graphics).

